		(property "Description" "USB-C 16-position receptacle. One shared symbol, two mount-style footprints: J_USB-C-16P_SMD (straight, TYPE-C 16P LTH6.8/C5187468, default) and J_USB-C-16P_SMD-RA (right-angle, TYPE-C 16PIN 2MD(073)/C2765186). GND1/GND2 and VBUS1/VBUS2 are the two mirrored USB-C contact banks (tie together on the PCB per USB-C spec); SHIELD1/SHIELD2 are the two mounting/chassis tabs. Pin numbers are canonical across both footprints (both footprints' native alphanumeric pad labels were remapped to this numbering). When placing the RA variant, override this instance's Footprint/MPN/LCSC Part/Datasheet fields to the _RA values."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
